@startuml

salt
{
  <b>ORE STUDIO - REPORTING: CHANGE HOW A PRODUCT IS PRICED</b>
  <b>Edit BermudanSwaption</b>
  --
  Bound by 4 reports: Group Consolidated Exposure, Board Risk Dashboard, Treasury Sensitivity, Group DV01 by book.
  A change reaches the next run of each. A run already produced keeps what it ran with.
  { Model | ^BlackBachelier^ }
  { Engine | ^BlackBachelierSwaptionEngine^ }
  {#
    Parameter | Before | After | State
    Calibration | Bootstrap | - | will be dropped
    ShiftHorizon | 0.5 | - | will be dropped
    sx | 3.0 | - | will be dropped
  }
  {
    Scope
    (X) Make a copy for this report only
    ( ) Change this configuration for all 4 reports
  }
  { Change reason | ^Rectification^ }
  { Commentary | "Desk moved to the Bachelier model" }
  [ Cancel ] | [ Save ]
}

@enduml
